---
description: Moderation acts on other plugins' data only through their own routes and permissions; reports never name their reporter
globs: packages/plugin-moderation/**, packages/plugin-annotations/src/**, packages/plugin-submissions/src/server.ts, packages/plugin-submissions/src/github.ts
alwaysApply: false
